Werecreatures can summon monsters at will. If you have lycanthropy, you can too
you use the extended command #monster (hit # then m) and you will summon up
a bunch of whatever you are, (ie if you are a wererat, you will summon up rats
if you are a werejackel, you will summon up jackels)
Another fun trick is if you are a female dragon, snake, Naga, anything that
lays eggs, use the extended command #sit and you will lay an egg, and later
the egg will hatch, and the baby will say "Mommy!" and will be your pet. Quite
amusing the first time you see it. It can also be very helpful. I jad about 10
baby dragons as pets once :^)

